; Absolute time tags, alone and mixed with relative ones.
;
; The e2e test starts the clock a minute before the earliest absolute time
; (2026-001T12:00:00Z), then again a minute after the latest, when every
; absolute time has already passed.

A2026-001T12:00:00 CdhCore.cmdDisp.CMD_NO_OP
; Relative to the completion of the absolute command before it
R00:00:01.500000 CdhCore.cmdDisp.CMD_NO_OP_STRING "relative after absolute"
A2026-001T12:00:30.250 CdhCore.cmdDisp.CMD_TEST_CMD_1 -7 2.5 255
; Due at the same moment as the previous one, so runs once that completes
A2026-001T12:00:30.250 CdhCore.cmdDisp.CMD_NO_OP
; Already in the past by the time it is reached
A2026-001T11:00:00 CdhCore.cmdDisp.CMD_NO_OP_STRING "already past"
R00:00:00 CdhCore.cmdDisp.CMD_NO_OP
A2026-001T12:01:00.000001 CdhCore.cmdDisp.CMD_NO_OP_STRING "one microsecond in"
